---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Projects" description="Portfolio of research projects and case studies">
  <div class="portfolio-container">
    <h1>Projects & Portfolio</h1>
    <p class="intro-text">A showcase of research projects, applications, and case studies from my work in network science, NLP, and computational social science.</p>

    <div class="projects-grid">
      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <h3>NFT Market Explorer Networks</h3>
          <span class="project-tag">Network Science</span>
        </div>
        <p class="project-description">Analysis of wallet exploration patterns across NFT collections using Lévy flight models and visual similarity metrics. Demonstrates how purchase trajectories vary across collectors and how visual features influence exploration behavior.</p>
        <div class="project-tech">
          <span>Network Analysis</span>
          <span>Computer Vision</span>
          <span>Python</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <h3>Global STEM Postdoctoral Mobility</h3>
          <span class="project-tag">Career Analytics</span>
        </div>
        <p class="project-description">Large-scale analysis of postdoctoral researcher mobility patterns using ORCID data. Examined international movements across five STEM fields, identifying gender differences and regional attractiveness for research talent.</p>
        <div class="project-tech">
          <span>Statistical Analysis</span>
          <span>Migration Patterns</span>
          <span>R/Python</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <h3>Social Media Misinformation Dynamics</h3>
          <span class="project-tag">NLP & Social Media</span>
        </div>
        <p class="project-description">Investigation of how false information spreads across social networks, examining user behavior patterns, network topology effects, and temporal dynamics of information cascades.</p>
        <div class="project-tech">
          <span>NLP</span>
          <span>Network Analysis</span>
          <span>Machine Learning</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <h3>Cultural Evolution in Digital Communities</h3>
          <span class="project-tag">Computational Social Science</span>
        </div>
        <p class="project-description">Analysis of how cultural norms, memes, and ideas evolve within online communities. Studies collective behavior patterns and mechanisms driving cultural change in digital spaces.</p>
        <div class="project-tech">
          <span>Text Mining</span>
          <span>Cultural Analytics</span>
          <span>Visualization</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <h3>Knowledge Creation Networks</h3>
          <span class="project-tag">Bibliometrics</span>
        </div>
        <p class="project-description">Network science approach to understanding how knowledge is created and disseminated in academic communities. Analyzes citation patterns, collaboration networks, and research impact.</p>
        <div class="project-tech">
          <span>Bibliometrics</span>
          <span>Graph Analysis</span>
          <span>Visualization</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <h3>Center for Applied Analytics & AI</h3>
          <span class="project-tag">Leadership</span>
        </div>
        <p class="project-description">Directing research initiatives focusing on applied analytics solutions for business problems. Collaborating with industry partners and leading student research projects in machine learning and data science.</p>
        <div class="project-tech">
          <span>Analytics</span>
          <span>AI/ML</span>
          <span>Mentoring</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .portfolio-container {
      max-width: 1000px;
    }

    .portfolio-container h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .intro-text {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .projects-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .project-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .project-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-accent);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .project-header {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .project-header h3 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin: 0;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .project-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      background-color: var(--color-accent);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .project-description {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .project-tech {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .project-tech span {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      background-color: var(--color-border);
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .portfolio-container h1 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }

      .projects-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .project-header {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .project-tag {
        align-self: flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Page>
